WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.657
1. Go to Suppliers and click the supplier's name.

2
00:00:02.657 --> 00:00:07.988
2. On Overview, click Edit. Choose the Relationship owner and the Tier.

3
00:00:07.988 --> 00:00:16.885
3. Set the Risk and say why, and when the Next business review is due. Click Save details.

4
00:00:16.885 --> 00:00:30.037
4. Click Add contact to add someone at the supplier, with their role, email and phone.
